{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0057_mother_01",
      "hash": "9afa4a3aa9c825e6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "媽媽「哇，好可愛！\\n是從博士那裡拿到的吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0057_mother_02",
      "hash": "9afa493aa9c82433",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……什麼！\\n是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳自己捉到的？\\c\\n好厲害呀！\\n牠叫什麼名字？\\c\\n……原來如此！\\n牠叫[VAR PKNICK(0003)]呀！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0057_poke_01",
      "hash": "57ee1af82b92f090",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "皮～卡丘～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0057_poke_02",
      "hash": "57ee1df82b92f5a9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "伊～布伊～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0057_mother_03",
      "hash": "9afa483aa9c82280",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "媽媽「哇！真有精神！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0057_mother_05",
      "hash": "9afa4e3aa9c82cb2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你們接下來\\n就要踏上冒險的旅程了吧。\\c\\n我早就有預感這一天會到來，\\n所以提前準備了這個。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0057_sys_01",
      "hash": "f7649187e2f0b6be",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從媽媽那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]城鎮地圖[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0057_sys_02",
      "hash": "f7649087e2f0b50b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0057_mother_04",
      "hash": "9afa4f3aa9c82e65",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "只要從包包裡查看城鎮地圖，\\n就能知道自己在哪裡了呢。\\c\\n好了，[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，\\n還有[VAR PKNICK(0003)]！路上小心喔！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0057_max",
      "hash": "9439473c31220ba3"
    }
  ]
}
